{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"992751","name":"Palais Tara & Spa","description":"Well set in Marrakech, Palais Tara & Spa provides air-conditioned rooms, a garden, free WiFi and a shared lounge. Featuring room service, this property also provides guests with a terrace. The accommodation offers airport transfers, while a bicycle rental service is also available. At the riad, each room has a desk. Every room comes with a private bathroom with a bidet, free toiletries and a hairdryer. At Palais Tara & Spa each room is equipped with bed linen and towels. A continental, vegetarian or vegan breakfast is available daily at the property. At the accommodation you will find a restaurant serving Moroccan cuisine. Vegetarian, vegan and dairy-free options can also be requested. The area is popular for cycling. Popular points of interest near the riad include Le Jardin Secret, Mouassine Museum and Djemaa El Fna.","address":"Rue Fhal Zefriti, 55","city":"Marrakech","countryCode":"MA","postalCode":"40000","lat":31.6268917,"lng":-7.9915369,"stars":4,"giataCode":"1395364","phone":"+212633257747","email":"palaistara.spa@gmail.com","website":"www.palaistara.com","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/99/992751/992751a_hb_a_002_20250504_094631.jpg","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/99/992751/992751a_hb_a_003_20250504_094633.jpg","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/99/992751/992751a_hb_a_004_20250504_094634.jpg","category":"exterior","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/99/992751/992751a_hb_a_005_20250504_094636.jpg","category":"exterior","order":3},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/99/992751/992751a_hb_l_001_20250504_094730.jpg","category":"lobby","order":4},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/99/992751/992751a_hb_l_002_20250504_095016.jpg","category":"lobby","order":5},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/